1331:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****     [..]  This section provides functions allowing to:
1332:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       (+) Configure simple output channel
1333:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       (+) Start simple output compare
1334:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       (+) Stop simple output compare
1335:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       (+) Start simple output compare and enable interrupt
1336:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       (+) Stop simple output compare and disable interrupt
1337:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       (+) Start simple output compare and enable DMA transfer
1338:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       (+) Stop simple output compare and disable DMA transfer
1339:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****        -@- When a HRTIM timer operates in simple output compare mode
1340:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****            the output level is set to a programmable value when a match
1341:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****            is found between the compare register and the counter.
1342:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****            Compare unit 1 is automatically associated to output 1
1343:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****            Compare unit 2 is automatically associated to output 2
1344:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c **** @endverbatim
