1363:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****   *                    @arg HRTIM_OUTPUT_TB1: Timer B - Output 1
1364:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****   *                    @arg HRTIM_OUTPUT_TB2: Timer B - Output 2
1365:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****   *                    @arg HRTIM_OUTPUT_TC1: Timer C - Output 1
1366:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****   *                    @arg HRTIM_OUTPUT_TC2: Timer C - Output 2
