1372:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****   *                    @arg HRTIM_OUTPUT_TF2: Timer F - Output 2
1373:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****   * @param  pSimpleOCChannelCfg pointer to the simple output compare output configuration structure
1374:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****   * @note When the timer operates in simple output compare mode:
1375:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****   *         Output 1 is implicitly controlled by the compare unit 1
1376:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****   *         Output 2 is implicitly controlled by the compare unit 2
1377:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****   *       Output Set/Reset crossbar is set according to the selected output compare mode:
1378:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****   *         Toggle: SETxyR = RSTxyR = CMPy
