1381:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****   * @retval HAL status
1382:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****   */
