1969:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****               ##### Simple PWM output functions #####
1970:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****  ===============================================================================
1971:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****     [..]  This section provides functions allowing to:
1972:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       (+) Configure simple PWM output channel
1973:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       (+) Start simple PWM output
1974:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       (+) Stop simple PWM output
1975:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       (+) Start simple PWM output and enable interrupt
1976:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       (+) Stop simple PWM output and disable interrupt
1977:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       (+) Start simple PWM output and enable DMA transfer
1978:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       (+) Stop simple PWM output and disable DMA transfer
1979:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       -@- When a HRTIM timer operates in simple PWM output mode
1980:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****           the output level is set to a programmable value when a match is
1981:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****           found between the compare register and the counter and reset when
1982:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****           the timer period is reached. Duty cycle is determined by the
1983:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****           comparison value.
1984:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****           Compare unit 1 is automatically associated to output 1
1985:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****           Compare unit 2 is automatically associated to output 2
1986:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c **** @endverbatim
