3336:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****       -@- When a HRTIM timer operates in simple one pulse mode
3337:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_hrtim.c ****           the timer counter is started in response to transition detected
